# Move the end effector (the last top plate) to a pose.
# target: same as GetJointPosIK.target = (x, y, z, roll, pitch, yaw)
#   x, y, z in model length units, roll, pitch, yaw [rad]
#   only the 3 components selected by ocktabot_kinematics' ik_spec are enforced
float64[6] target
---
bool success
string message
float64[6] pose              # measured end-effector pose after the move
---
float64[3] motor_positions   # [rad] at the gearbox output
float64[6] pose              # current end-effector pose
